From: Michael Bestas <mkbestas@lineageos.org>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:44:53 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Merge tag 'WLAN.LA.2.0.r3-10600-kaanapali.0' into staging/lineage-24.0_merge-WLAN.LA.2.0.r3-10600-kaanapali.0

WLAN.LA.2.0.r3-10600-kaanapali.0

* tag 'WLAN.LA.2.0.r3-10600-kaanapali.0': (30 commits)
  wifi_hal: Remove old peer entries using NIK
  Revert^6 "wpa_supplicant_8_lib: Testing coral workflow"
  Revert^5 "wpa_supplicant_8_lib: Testing coral workflow"
  Revert^4 "wpa_supplicant_8_lib: Testing coral workflow"
  Revert^3 "wpa_supplicant_8_lib: Testing coral workflow"
  Revert^2 "wpa_supplicant_8_lib: Testing coral workflow"
  Revert "wpa_supplicant_8_lib: Testing coral workflow"
  wpa_supplicant_8_lib: Testing coral workflow
  wpa_supplicant_8_lib: split named-command dispatch from ioctl fallback
  wifi_hal: Add null iface handle checks to all vendor HAL functions
  nan: Update pub_sub_id and requestor_instance_id from followup indication
  wifiHal: Fixed Compilation issue for LE Env
  Add QCA vendor interface to support Time Average SAR (TAS)
  wifi-hal: Change one nan msg to debug level
  wifi_hal: update qca-vendor_copy.h
  wifiHal: Update log_event_host_reason_code enum
  wifiHal: Enable error logging on event sockets
  WIFI-HAL: Add support for STA DFS channel configuration
  wifi_hal: Remove TARGET_SUPPORTS_WEARABLES flag
  wpa_supplicant: Add PA report v2 support with golden PDADC values
  ...

Change-Id: I51ac43a1af5343e1f68d52c86e6b70d814b28452
